This repository includes DGN4CFD graph-autoencoder, message-passing, mesh,
normalization and batching code originating from:
  https://github.com/tum-pbs/dgn4cfd
and the CylinderFlow adaptation in:
  https://github.com/yan-borui/graph-dit-cylinderflow-stride8
  Source revision: e139e24046b387e32dc816800fed92b53bbb3e21

The bundled dgn4cfd package retains the upstream VGAE/message-passing and
Guillard coarsening implementation. The base Model and Graph wrappers have
been reduced to the standalone dependency surface, and public exports and
formatting have been adjusted. The vgae_cf package supplies UV adaptation,
physical metrics adapted from the CylinderFlow evaluator, four-GPU training,
checkpointing, evaluation, representation export, and campaign management.
No pretrained upstream model weights are bundled or loaded for training.

Data are downloaded from their separate publisher and remain subject to
that dataset's distribution terms. The software license does not relicense
the dataset or third-party Python dependencies.
